  <ym-title|Actual angular actions and normalized
  stress><label|actual-angular-actions-and-normalized-stress>

  Source revision: <verbatim|3456e5e75cf8d4cd558955a5c7638fba2d68f464>.
  Author: parent session <verbatim|hairer-codex-existence-20261111>, within
  #26 claim. Prose: <verbatim|manuscript/existence/physical-angular-actions.tex>.
  Status: draft; independent source/mathematical review pending.

  <section|Scope><label|scope>

  Consumes physical Ward propagation p=c partial with one real c\<neq\>0,
  global Still, Brackets, Hyper, and the same-Track
  derivative/translation/angular comparisons. That upstream package is
  actively drafted separately; this chapter does not supply it or the annular
  producer. Constructs the exact same-U rotation action and tensorial stress,
  then matches the existing calibrated-action input for Lorentz descent. Uses
  the same free Maxwell rotation/Lorentz actions and their known
  compatibility; no fresh witness.

  <section|Inspected correspondence><label|inspected-correspondence>

  All paths relative to <verbatim|Lean/YM/> at the pinned revision.

